  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1058691757882262}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 337
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你若对此事感兴趣，我可以把这信物借给你。若是真调查出什么异变，你也可以尽快通知各大门派知晓。
  description:
