--- !u!114 &114861078792018164
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1058691757882262}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 954
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 嗯...此事倒也不算什么辛秘。这御剑门是数百年前因为{color=#d0380a}私通魔门{/color}，而被宁州五大门派一起围攻而亡的。战况之惨烈，当年在宁州可谓无人不知无人不晓。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
